  "title": "Six-Egg Pound Cake",
  "description": "Made with six eggs, this pound cake recipe outshines other pound cake recipes with its lofty height and just needs a dusting of sugar to enjoy.",
  "authors": [
    "Diane Dippolito"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-08-06T21:09:06-04:00",
